ALVA — Universal Fighter Difficulty & Play Style UI Update

Objective

Update ALVA’s fighter roster interface so every roster consistently displays each playable fighter’s difficulty rating and provides access to their play-style description.

The system currently exists in Discover → Fighters. Extend it throughout the game while improving its presentation.

This is a focused UI/UX update. Preserve ALVA’s existing visual identity, gameplay systems, navigation behavior, and character data.

1. Understand the existing architecture

Repository: hiyroscript/alva

Review these files before implementing:

Core UI

* js/ui/fighter-roster.js — Shared roster grid, selection logic, animated previews, and Confirm button.
* js/ui/fighter-browser.js — Discover’s existing difficulty stars and play-style action.
* js/data/fighter-profiles.js — Difficulty ratings and localized description references.
* js/ui/overlays.js — Existing InfoDialog implementation.

