Run the full test suite:

node --test

Resolve regressions caused by the changes.

12. Final acceptance criteria

The update is complete only when:

* All existing roster instances support difficulty ratings and play-style descriptions.
* The stars have no visible “Difficulty” label.
* The button text is “Read play style”.
* That button is visibly smaller and positioned at the bottom-right.
* The existing play-style modal works consistently everywhere.
* Discover maintains its read-only behavior.
* Selection screens and Practice Ground retain their original functionality.
* Future fighters inherit the feature automatically.
* Documentation reflects the new behavior.
* Relevant automated tests pass.

Implementation priorities

1. Correct universal behavior.
2. Clean shared architecture.
3. Precise visual positioning.
4. Consistent responsive styling.
5. Accessibility and localization.
6. No unrelated gameplay or interface changes.

Do not redesign ALVA. Make this feel like a natural extension of the existing polished fighter-selection interface.

